# Local pre-change backups made before each build wave — kept on disk, not in git.
.index.pre-*.html

# The repo is public. Printouts, exports and photos from the pack almost always carry children's
# names (Trail's End reports, the Ideal Year PDF, rosters, event photos), so none of them are
# tracked. Nothing the site serves is one of these types today; if an image is ever needed, add
# a negation for that one file (e.g. !icon.png) rather than removing a line here.
*.pdf
*.csv
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.numbers
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.heic
*.tsv
*.xlsm
*.ods
*.doc
*.docx
*.pages
*.webp
*.heif
*.mov
*.mp4

# The app's own downloads. A backup (popcorn-backup.json) or a year-close snapshot
# (pack-year-*-snapshot.json) is the WHOLE pack record — every child, every family's money,
# leaders' contact details. Calendar, contact, zip, rich-text and saved-email exports carry
# names too. No tracked file is any of these today; if one ever has to be, negate just that file.
*.json
*.ics
*.zip
*.vcf
*.rtf
*.eml
